# Copy to `app/api/.env` (or the repo root) and fill in. Git-ignored.
# Loaded by `agents/__init__.py` at import, so every entry point sees it:
# the API background task, explorer.crawler, probe.py and smoke_run.py.
# An exported variable always wins over this file.

# One of these is strongly recommended. Without any, a run still
# produces a map -- `explorer.crawler` builds it breadth-first -- but it
# finishes `degraded`: no flows, no summary, and the intent is ignored.
#
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY is probed first, on cost: a colony run is ~78 model
# calls, measured at $0.089 on qwen3-coder-next against ~$3.42 on
# claude-opus-5. Set OPENROUTER_MODEL to use a different model, or
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL to point the same code at DeepSeek, Groq, Cerebras
# or a local Ollama -- they all speak chat-completions.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=qwen/qwen3-coder-next
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: what the form-filler types into sign-in fields it meets.
# AIVAR_USERNAME=
# AIVAR_PASSWORD=
